`isBrowser` from `_utils` — the barrel also imports `vue` stuff at top level, which executes `defineComponent` etc. If external returns a Proxy stub, module-load-time calls like `defineComponent({...})` would run a stub returning undefined — probably fine as long as nothing throws.

seemly: `getPadding` used at runtime only.

